description.narrative:
The overall objective (Impact) of this Action is to support Ukraines progressive alignment to the EU Acquis and its overall EU integration efforts with a view to future EU membership.

The specific objective (Outcome) of this Action is improved state mechanisms in the management of Ukraine's EU accession process and implementation of its related reforms.
Expected Outputs:
1. Strengthened capacities of Ukraine's key actors and stakeholders in overall management, coordination, and monitoring of the EU accession process and related reforms agenda; 
2. Increased availability of the legal expertise necessary for an efficient approximation of Ukrainian law to the EU acquis;
3. Enhanced overall institutional, procedural and methodological capacities of competent institutions in EU acquis translation;
4. Raised awareness of Ukrainian society and key stakeholder groups on the EU accession process and related reforms agenda.
